<div class="callout"><span class="callout__title">Budget Prioritisation for Scandi Interiors</span>If working with a limited budget, spend disproportionately on: (1) lighting — specifically warm LED strips, a good pendant and a floor lamp, which together cost ₹40,000–₹90,000 and transform the atmosphere more than any other single investment; (2) the rug — a quality jute or Dhurrie rug in 6x9 or 8x10 ft anchors the living space; (3) linen curtains — they frame the windows and soften the entire room. Everything else can be phased.</div>
<h4>Where to Spend Generously</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Lighting — pendants, floor lamps, dimmer switches</li>
  <li>Linen curtains — full length, natural fabric, quality header tape</li>
  <li>The sofa — it anchors the room for 10+ years</li>
  <li>Hardware — matte black or brushed nickel, European brands</li>
  <li>Wardrobe system — floor to ceiling, soft-close, well-organised interior</li>
